rooms_desc ({"You are standing at the end of a stone path. Up ahead it winds through a a grove of tall dark oak trees scattering shade and sunlightacross the path. On either side thick lush grass grows aroundthe roots of the trees. You can here the wind whisper through the leaves of the trees overhead, giving you a feeling of peace and relaxation.At the end of the path is a large stone house of Victorian design. ","You are standing in Denebs living room. This room is decorated with beautifulantique furniture from the Victorian era. The couch, chairs, and table are carved from solid oak and polished to a dark shine. They are covered with ablue velvet and embroidered with scenes of spring, birds, trees, and flowers.The rug is a soft plush white. Lush green potted plants adorn the tables and corners of the room. To the west a sliding door opens onto a patio, where you can watch the sun seton hot summer nights. The door is open and light green silk curtains around it waft in a cool spring breeze. You can smell an exotic mixture of fragrances drifting in from the garden. ","You are standing on a sanded wood patio. Sun chairs lie facing west, and a picknick table rests in the center. To the south, wooden steps lead down into aan enchanting garden. A light spring breeze carries the fragrance of flowers up to the deck. Past the garden you see tall trees the sun shining into their branches. You can hear the sound of water running somewherebeyond sight. As you look up into the sky you can see the stars begginingto come out one by one as the sun sets, casting rays of fading color across the skyA bird wistles softly in the garden; you can hear crickets begin to chirp.There are candles set in transparant stained glass cups around the porch casting a soft multi-colored glow across the sanded wood of the deck. ","You are in a Dimly lit hallway. Rooms extend off of it on either side. The walls are covered with a slightly faded off white wall paper decorated with pictures of tiny roses and vines. Glass lamps bathe the area in a warm light from  their brass fixtures on the walls. Rooms extend off of this hall way from either side. The hallways continutes north , the livingroom is south. ","You are in Deneb's kitchen. A wide bay window lets in the morning light to the east. The kitchen contains all the nessecities of modern life, a microwave, stove, dishwasher, plenty of pots and pansand the cupboards are stocked with foods from all over the world. Deneb's special spaggetti sauce is on a slow simmer on the front burner.The room is filled with the spicy smell of oregano, garlic, mmm, and something delicious that you cant quite put your finger on. help yourself to all the delicious food! bon apetite!","You are at the end of a long hallway. Glass lamps light the hallway on either side. To the nother a winding staircaseleads up into a tower. The hallway has a warm cosy feeling, but it could be scary at night. Rooms adjoin the hallway on eith side, the hallway continues ot the south. ","You are in a stairway winding upwards through a stone tower. Candles inwrought iron holders flicker lighting the granite walls eerily. The wooden steps creak as you move. The polished wood of the staps has beenworn down over the years. You can see light dimly from a doorway at the top of the stairs, below light from the hall baths the entrance of the stair. ","You are at the top of the tower. This seems to be the bedroom. To the east is a circular stained glass window which sends a dazzlingarray of color across the room each morning. To the westa sliding door opens onto a balcony extending around the tower. The door is open and a light brezze wafts the silk curtains carryingthe scent of climbing roses. The sun is setting outside castinga warm glow across the room .The bed stands against the north wall; it is built from dark wood and ornately carved. The sheets and blankets and blue-green and blueand green curtains hang from the canopy. The ceiling is covered with glow in the dark stars. On the desk are some books about electrical engineering and plasma physics as well as a copy of The Fountainhead and a complete set of the collected works of Robert A. Heinlein. On the south wall is a dazzling mural depicting a future of civilization in space. The music of Mozarts \"Requiem\" is playing on the stereo. ","You have entered what appears to be a private... or perhaps not so private place. The windows are shaded and the room is lit by the warm glow of candles and the soft glow of a blue light. The floor is carpeted wita thick soft carpet. At one end is a large brass bed. It looks recently slept in ... or something. You notice a piece of rope loosely tied around of the bedposts. A flicker of light catches you eye drawing your attentionto the mirrored ceiling. On the walls are a number of erotic charcoaldrawings. You feel embarrassed that you have walked into someones private room,yet are somewhat aroused. ","The stairs lead down into a vast garden. Peace descends on your soul.You feel you could spend the rest of your life here in perfect contentment. You take off your shoes and walk barefoot on the grass. Stone pathways run randomly between groves of flowering trees, pines, and shady elms. To the north is a large field of wildflowers with random dirt paths winding throughit. A brook runs west into a small wood. In its center is a small clearingWith a firepit and logs for friends to gather their and camp beneath the stars. It is a cool spring evening the sun sets to the west behindthe tops of the trees. The brook collects in a small pool beneath atumbling rapids. The water is clear and inviting, the stones on the bottomsmoothed. The wind wispers through the branches of the trees sendingflower petals tumbling through the air to land floating on the surface of the water. Above you a few stars are just beggining to come out. ",})
rooms_short ({"A shady stone path leads to the entrance to Denebs home.","Deneb's living room. Furnished with antique furniture in shades of blue and green ","The west patio of Deneb's house, overlooking the garden. ","A dimly lit hallway in Deneb's house. ","A spacious kitchen , bathed in morning light. ","The end of the hallway in Deneb's House. ","A stairway, winding up through a stone tower. ","Deneb's Tower Bedroom","Deneb's secret room.","The garden of eternal peace. ",})
